---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="回声记忆 · 游乐场" active="lab"><a class="back-link" href="/lab/">← 返回游乐场</a><header class="lab-description"><div><p class="eyebrow">EXPERIMENT 003 / ECHO MEMORY</p><h1>回声记忆</h1><p>看清闪烁的顺序，再原样重复。每完成一轮，序列就会增加一个颜色。</p></div><span class="pill">小游戏</span></header><div class="experiment-surface memory-surface"><p id="memory-message" role="status" aria-live="polite">准备好了？从一小段回声开始。</p><div class="memory-pad" aria-label="记忆游戏按键">{['绿','橙','黄','蓝'].map((color,i)=><button class="memory-key" data-key={i} aria-label={`${color}色，按键 ${i+1}`} disabled>{i+1}<span>{color}</span></button>)}</div><div class="memory-controls"><button class="button primary" id="memory-start">开始游戏 ↗</button><p>本轮 <strong id="memory-round">0</strong> / 最高 <strong id="memory-best">0</strong></p></div></div><section class="experiment-info"><div><h2>怎么玩</h2><p>先观察颜色闪烁，再点击对应的方块。也可以按键盘 1、2、3、4。轮次越高，序列越长；答错后可重新开始。最高轮次记录的是已经成功完成的轮次。</p></div><div><h2>小而完整的实验</h2><p>没有时间倒计时，按自己的节奏回忆。闪烁阶段方块会暂时锁定；点击“重新开始”可以随时换一段序列。切换到其他页面或标签时，游戏会暂停并要求重播序列。</p></div></section></Layout>
<script>
const keys=Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.memory-key'));const start=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#memory-start')!;const message=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#memory-message')!;const round=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#memory-round')!;const bestEl=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#memory-best')!;
let seq:number[]=[],input=0,accepting=false,token=0,best=0,paused=false;try{best=Number(localStorage.getItem('zq-echo-best'))||0;}catch{}bestEl.textContent=String(best);
const delay=(ms:number)=>new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,ms));function lock(value:boolean){accepting=!value;keys.forEach(k=>k.disabled=value);}
async function show(){const id=++token;lock(true);input=0;keys.forEach(k=>k.classList.remove('lit'));message.textContent='仔细观察，这一轮的顺序是……';await delay(550);for(const n of seq){if(id!==token)return;keys[n].classList.add('lit');await delay(460);if(id!==token)return;keys[n].classList.remove('lit');await delay(200);}if(id!==token)return;message.textContent=`轮到你了：重复 ${seq.length} 个颜色。`;lock(false);}
function next(){seq.push(Math.floor(Math.random()*4));round.textContent=String(seq.length);void show();}
function choose(n:number){if(!accepting)return;const id=token;keys[n].classList.add('lit');setTimeout(()=>{if(id===token)keys[n].classList.remove('lit');},160);if(seq[input]!==n){++token;lock(true);keys.forEach(k=>k.classList.remove('lit'));message.textContent=`回声中断了。你完成了 ${seq.length-1} 轮，再试一次吧。`;start.textContent='再试一次 ↗';return;}input++;if(input===seq.length){lock(true);best=Math.max(best,seq.length);bestEl.textContent=String(best);try{localStorage.setItem('zq-echo-best',String(best));}catch{}message.textContent='记住了！下一段回声正在到来。';const current=token;setTimeout(()=>{if(current===token)next();},850);}}
keys.forEach((k,i)=>k.addEventListener('click',()=>choose(i)));start.addEventListener('click',()=>{++token;keys.forEach(k=>k.classList.remove('lit'));if(paused){paused=false;start.textContent='重新开始 ↗';void show();return;}seq=[];input=0;start.textContent='重新开始 ↗';next();});document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.repeat||e.altKey||e.ctrlKey||e.metaKey)return;const n=Number(e.key)-1;if(n>=0&&n<4){e.preventDefault();choose(n);}});document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',()=>{if(document.hidden&&seq.length){++token;lock(true);keys.forEach(k=>k.classList.remove('lit'));paused=true;message.textContent='游戏已暂停。回来后重播这一轮的序列。';start.textContent='重播本轮 ▷';}});
</script>
